Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:05.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every safety tool gates the irreversible step.\NThis one reorders the plan around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:15.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,A confirmation dialog is a lookup nobody performed, handed over\Nat the one instant it cannot be afforded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:30.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Four plans that actually happened, encoded from their own written post-mortems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:43.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,This one is an eight-day hackathon.\NSix point four days of irreversibility, bought for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:01:02.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,The category was chosen on day zero - six days to reverse. The file that\Nwould have changed it was sitting in the operator's own notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:10.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Reading it cost ninety seconds. It was opened on day six.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.50,0:01:24.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,So HOIST lifts the lookup above the commitment,\Nwith every hard dependency still intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:31.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,It moves the minimum it can defend moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:43.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,And where it cannot lift, it says so.\NThe claims audit cannot precede writing the claims.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:58.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Now a plan where one cost was never stated.\NHOIST emits no schedule at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:08.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,A schedule you cannot check is worse than no schedule,\Nbecause it looks like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:19.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Zero network requests since load. No model, no backend,\Nnothing you have to take on faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:32.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Look before you commit. Computed, not advised.
